 "strategy": "I have never played this before and need some major help for strategy.\n\nI'll explain some of my choices:\n\nBravo 2 + Dolphe - Deploy for 3, power 4, draws a battle destiny, opponent's BD's are - 2\n\nGold 3 + Torsyn - Deploy 3, power 4, retrieve a force when deployed to Dantooine, force drain +1 at dantooine, and destiny to total power\n\nRomas \"Lock\" Navander - pulls systems while at Spaceport DB\n\nKiffex - Good generation and drain\n\nKessel - real good drain\n\ni am working on getting Queen's Royal Starship so Ric will go on there.\n\nkeep in mind, i only have one personna of most of the characters, except han.  i have almost every han.",
